[*] GTKWave layout for tb_demo (8-bit prefix adder)
[timestart] 0
@200
-INPUTS
@22
tb_demo.a[7:0]
tb_demo.b[7:0]
@28
tb_demo.cin
@200
-PREFIX NETWORK (G = generate, binary: bit7..bit0)
@28
tb_demo.dut.G0[7:0]
tb_demo.dut.G1[7:0]
tb_demo.dut.G2[7:0]
@200
-CARRIES (G3[i] = carry out of bit i)
@28
tb_demo.dut.G3[7:0]
@200
-OUTPUTS
@22
tb_demo.sum[7:0]
@28
tb_demo.cout
